:Idea_Comments a dkg:Idea ; skos:prefLabel "Comments" ; dkg:inCluster :Cluster_ContentRating ; dkg:source :Art_Brainstorm ; dkg:locator "Content Rating" ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .
