# Exact label + same spine class (Actor) but a canvas segment vs Wardley user: propose, per the BMC hazard rule.
:Act_Singles_BMC dkg:proposedSameAs :Act_Singles, :Act_Single ; rdfs:comment "exact match with the Wardley user; segment vs user kept apart until confirmed" .
